<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>DevOps Assignment Server</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f9; padding: 50px; text-align: center; }
        .card { background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; }
        h1 { color: #2c3e50; }
        p { font-size: 1.2em; color: #555; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>Сервер успешно настроен через Ansible!</h1>
        <p><strong>Имя хоста:</strong> {{ inventory_hostname }}</p>
        <p><strong>Внутренний IP:</strong> {{ ansible_default_ipv4.address }}</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
